WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Five words today can be five points tomorrow.. Do not rush; clarity comes before

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.500
speed.. At your own pace, in your own direction.. The exam is a door, not a

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.500
wall.. Study at the same hour; your brain sets its clock.. English is not a

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.500
subject, it is a habit.. One pattern learned today saves a sentence tomorrow..

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.500
The patient learner overtakes the fast one.. Nobody was born with Band 8.. Even

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.500
a single correct answer is progress..
